WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Please keep what I'm about to sing

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Just between us, okay?</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>The truth is, I want to keep my
desires hidden deep in my heart</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>A secret, a secret</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>I</i> want <i>to take shortcuts</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Never getting soaked by the rain</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
<i>Never getting knocked over by the wind</i>

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
<i>Even if that's being devious, smile</i>

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Even if I'm a coward, play with me</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
<i>I don't</i> want <i>to feel sad</i>

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
<i>Never getting soaked by tears</i>

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Never feeling at my wit's end</i>

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
<i>Just smile and think I'm insensitive</i>

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Only tell me about fun things</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>See, there are faces I</i> want <i>to
see and voices I</i> want <i>to hear</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
<i>When I wake up I trumpet my joy:</i>

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
Good morning!
Let's have another fine day!

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:36.764 --> 00:01:40.017
What a fierce attack has
breached our castle walls!

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:43.729
We've been saying for a while
that we had to fix this corner, huh...

00:01:43.813 --> 00:01:47.775
These lines look like the
Metropolitan subway map.

00:01:56.117 --> 00:01:59.704
Clara... you've got it so good...

00:02:09.338 --> 00:02:10.965
No!

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:14.760
I want to forget! I want to forget!
I want to forget! <i>I</i> want to forget!

00:02:14.844 --> 00:02:16.345
"Could it be evil spirits again?
--Memories, begone!

00:02:16.429 --> 00:02:18.222
Whatever, where's Chieko?

00:02:18.306 --> 00:02:20.224
On the phone, I think...

00:02:20.308 --> 00:02:22.643
What are you saying?

00:02:22.727 --> 00:02:24.979
I'm saying I decided to sell!

00:02:25.062 --> 00:02:28.024
People have been trying to
get us to for years, you know!

00:02:28.107 --> 00:02:30.526
I thought this might be the perfect opportunity.

00:02:30.609 --> 00:02:35.656
So, I'm thinking I'll use the
money to study language in Korea!

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.325
But Mother...

00:02:37.408 --> 00:02:40.619
You tell all the boarders, okay honey?

00:02:40.703 --> 00:02:46.751
Just say, "Amamizu-kan'll be
gone a year from now! Sorry, girls."

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:48.294
But...

00:02:48.377 --> 00:02:51.297
"I Want to Be a Jellyfish"

00:03:02.892 --> 00:03:04.268
Please excuse me.

00:03:04.352 --> 00:03:07.021
Shu, are you done already?

00:03:07.104 --> 00:03:09.732
I'm sorry; I'm just not hungry...

00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:12.318
<i>Is he lovesick after all'? Because he's a virgin?</i>

00:03:12.401 --> 00:03:14.028
He's a virgin!

00:03:14.111 --> 00:03:17.615
Are you all right?
That presentation is today, isn't it?

00:03:17.698 --> 00:03:22.870
Yes. I'm just sleep-deprived.
I stayed up late last night researching.

00:03:22.953 --> 00:03:25.456
<i>A virgin researching on the internet'?</i>

00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:27.333
He's a virgin!

00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:30.795
<i>Like... on how to kiss and stuff...?</i>

00:03:30.795 --> 00:03:31.087
"Search"

00:03:32.088 --> 00:03:36.342
"If she closes her eyes, she's giving you the OK."

00:03:36.425 --> 00:03:37.259
A nosebleed!

00:03:37.343 --> 00:03:38.094
<i>That's sickening!</i>

00:03:38.135 --> 00:03:40.054
He's a virgin!

00:03:40.137 --> 00:03:44.058
Why, Kuranosuke, you
haven't eaten a bite either.

00:03:44.141 --> 00:03:48.562
Huh? Oh, yeah, it was
sickening--I mean, I have to get going.

00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:49.605
To class?

00:03:49.688 --> 00:03:53.484
Exactly. Well, then, if you'll excuse me, Father...

00:03:55.111 --> 00:03:55.945
For heaven's sake.

00:03:56.028 --> 00:03:58.364
Well, I have to get ready too.

00:03:58.447 --> 00:04:04.412
Shu. Even if they ask you something,
don't make your position clear.

00:04:04.495 --> 00:04:08.916
Promoters of redevelopment projects
are always painted as the villains.

00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:11.752
Depending on the situation... you understand?

00:04:11.836 --> 00:04:12.795
Yes.

00:04:15.714 --> 00:04:20.553
<i>Mom, my chest feels too tight.</i>

00:04:20.636 --> 00:04:24.181
<i>I'm so mortified I don't</i>
want <i>to remember it at all,</i>

00:04:24.265 --> 00:04:28.227
<i>but somehow I always catch
myself thinking about</i> him...

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:32.731
<i>Each time, it feels as if someone's
wringing my heart out like a wet rag.</i>

00:04:32.815 --> 00:04:35.568
<i>I've never felt pain like this before.</i>

00:04:35.651 --> 00:04:39.238
<i>Don't tell me I'm starting to... fa-fa-fall...</i>

00:04:39.321 --> 00:04:40.573
Fall in!

00:04:40.656 --> 00:04:42.241
Tsukimi.

00:04:42.491 --> 00:04:44.952
"Amamizu Area Urban Renewal"
"Local Explanatory Presentation"

00:04:45.161 --> 00:04:46.954
We're marching to battle!

00:04:48.789 --> 00:04:50.166
A power outage?

00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:56.589
"Amamizu Area Urban Renewal"
"Local Explanatory Presentation"

00:04:59.091 --> 00:05:00.092
So this is the place...

00:05:00.176 --> 00:05:04.638
Even Dong Zhuo won't be
expecting an attack in all this rain!

00:05:04.722 --> 00:05:08.476
The smell of rain-soaked
asphalt is sort of nice, isn't it?

00:05:08.559 --> 00:05:13.981
Stay strong, everyone.
Amamizu-kan's future is at stake.

00:05:14.064 --> 00:05:14.815
Right.

00:05:14.857 --> 00:05:18.444
Forward... march!

00:05:22.781 --> 00:05:25.701
For some reason I'm scared all of a sudden...

00:05:25.784 --> 00:05:27.244
<i>I'll</i> wait here.

00:05:27.328 --> 00:05:28.245
Me, too.

00:05:28.329 --> 00:05:31.499
What?! I don't want to do this alone!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:35.127
Are you here for the
explanatory presentation, ladies?

00:05:35.211 --> 00:05:37.129
A-A career woman?!

00:05:37.213 --> 00:05:41.133
Please, come in; we're about to get started.

00:05:41.217 --> 00:05:42.468
Hmm? Er, hello?

00:05:42.551 --> 00:05:43.511
This is Clara!

00:05:43.594 --> 00:05:46.764
The Sisterhood can't cope
with career people in suits either.

00:05:46.847 --> 00:05:49.808
I'm sure it stirs up their insecurities.

00:05:50.893 --> 00:05:54.480
This way. There are plenty of seats.

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.067
Why is...

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.903
<i>...Kuranosuke's brother here?</i>

00:06:00.986 --> 00:06:03.572
...Amamizu-kan's legion of ghouls here?

00:06:05.032 --> 00:06:06.283
Where's Tsukimi?

00:06:06.367 --> 00:06:08.035
Here! Right here!

00:06:08.118 --> 00:06:09.995
Apparently Shu doesn't realize it's her.

00:06:10.079 --> 00:06:13.457
To think a simple change in
appearance makes him not recognize her...

00:06:13.541 --> 00:06:16.252
He seems to be a
particularly dense Homo sapien.

00:06:16.335 --> 00:06:17.294
Clara!

00:06:18.921 --> 00:06:21.382
I-It's kind of a different atmosphere...

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:22.800
Boy, do we stand out.

00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:24.802
E-Er, is this...

00:06:24.885 --> 00:06:28.889
All right, we're about to
start, so please sit down.

00:06:28.973 --> 00:06:30.641
Come right in! Here we go.

00:06:30.724 --> 00:06:32.393
Tsukimi! Lead the vanguard!

00:06:32.476 --> 00:06:33.644
What?!

00:06:35.521 --> 00:06:39.108
M-My heart! Hello... <i>I</i> have to say hello to him...!

00:06:41.235 --> 00:06:43.571
<i>Stop being so fast, heart!</i>

00:06:43.654 --> 00:06:47.825
Um... P-P-P-Pardon my rudeness the other day.

00:06:50.286 --> 00:06:52.413
<i>Is she talking about the zombie act'?</i>

00:06:52.496 --> 00:06:53.914
Right, sure.

00:06:53.998 --> 00:06:59.461
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you so
much for braving the rain to come here.

00:06:59.545 --> 00:07:05.676
I'd like to begin this presentation
on Amamizu Area Urban Renewal.

00:07:05.759 --> 00:07:10.389
I'm Shoko Inari, and
I represent Global City Create,

00:07:10.472 --> 00:07:13.684
the company who will be working

00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:17.187
on Amamizu area's redevelopment
project, "Active City Amamizu."

00:07:17.271 --> 00:07:19.231
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:07:32.202 --> 00:07:34.455
Tsukimi! Tsukimi!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.708
--The main elements of the redevelopment will be Hotel
Createur Tokyo, --I see a demon standing behind that vixen.

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:39.960
--The main elements of the redevelopment will be Hotel
Createur Tokyo, --She must be a servant of the underworld!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.962
--The main elements of the redevelopment will
be Hotel Createur Tokyo, --Mayaya, quiet down!

00:07:42.046 --> 00:07:44.923
--Our firm's luxury hotel, --The gentleman
next to her is really good-looking.

00:07:44.923 --> 00:07:45.424
--And the attached commercial facilities that will make up
Createur Mall. --The gentleman next to her is really good-looking.

00:07:45.424 --> 00:07:48.927
--And the attached commercial facilities that will make up
Createur Mall. --Let's put the train track on an overpass.

00:07:49.011 --> 00:07:51.513
You two would switch
your allegiance to the enemy?!

00:07:51.597 --> 00:07:55.351
That man is the Xun You to her Cao Cao!

00:07:55.434 --> 00:07:59.980
--Is he an older man, too?
--Excuse me, ladies in the fifth row!

00:08:00.064 --> 00:08:02.024
Do you have a question?

00:08:04.943 --> 00:08:07.112
Coming in at #1 on this week's

00:08:07.196 --> 00:08:09.948
"Things the Sisterhood Can't Deal With":

00:08:10.032 --> 00:08:11.825
"People looking at them"!

00:08:22.044 --> 00:08:24.129
We shall never forgive that vixen!

00:08:24.213 --> 00:08:27.383
She publicly...

00:08:28.676 --> 00:08:33.263
...humiliated us! It shall be
neither forgiven nor forgotten!

00:08:33.347 --> 00:08:35.265
It was your fault for acting up.

00:08:35.349 --> 00:08:37.685
Say, where's Chieko?

00:08:37.768 --> 00:08:39.103
Maybe we left her behind.

00:08:39.186 --> 00:08:41.313
I suppose she can't run in a kimono...

00:08:41.397 --> 00:08:43.023
I'll go get her.

00:08:43.107 --> 00:08:47.861
Oh, no, I'll go. This is a job for
the lowest one on the totem pole.

00:08:47.945 --> 00:08:49.530
Really?

00:08:51.073 --> 00:08:52.241
Yes!

00:08:53.659 --> 00:08:55.953
All right, let's break for ten minutes,

00:08:56.036 --> 00:08:58.622
and then I'll take your questions.

00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:02.334
My pouch.

00:09:02.418 --> 00:09:05.421
That man in the fifth row is
former minister Koibuchi's son.

00:09:05.504 --> 00:09:08.215
Really? You've got a keen eye.

00:09:08.298 --> 00:09:11.760
But the fact that he came today
means he'll support us, right?

00:09:11.844 --> 00:09:14.346
You just keep proving you've got a lot to learn.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.890
Old Baldy's approval
ratings are in the single digits.

00:09:16.974 --> 00:09:19.226
People are starting to call
for the dissolution of the Diet.

00:09:19.309 --> 00:09:23.731
There's a good chance they'll back the
opposition to score support if it comes to that.

00:09:23.814 --> 00:09:25.566
That's why he came.

00:09:25.649 --> 00:09:29.278
To figure out which
stance is to their advantage.

00:09:29.361 --> 00:09:31.572
Wait, does that mean
you're going to do the usual?!

00:09:31.655 --> 00:09:37.786
Obviously! Why do you think the
company's given me this position?

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:39.955
Oh, and I'll let you handle the Q&A session.

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:41.206
What?!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.256
Okay, then...

00:09:51.717 --> 00:09:55.012
Mom, we're powerless.

00:09:55.095 --> 00:09:57.139
<i>We got so intimidated by that beautiful lady,</i>

00:09:57.222 --> 00:10:00.392
<i>we</i> ran away without managing
to voice a single protest.

00:10:00.476 --> 00:10:03.353
<i>I'm sure he was disgusted, too.</i>

00:10:03.437 --> 00:10:07.065
Yes... today, he was...

00:10:07.149 --> 00:10:10.861
<i>He was like a different person
than the one at the aquarium.</i>

00:10:10.944 --> 00:10:14.573
<i>He didn't try to talk to me at all.</i>

00:10:14.656 --> 00:10:18.660
<i>Forget talking; he didn't even look my way.</i>

00:10:18.744 --> 00:10:21.413
<i>He was lost in admiration of the beautiful lady,</i>

00:10:21.497 --> 00:10:24.416
and <i>I</i> didn't even rate a glance.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:28.253
<i>My chest feels tight. My throat is burning.</i>

00:10:28.337 --> 00:10:29.713
I...

00:10:33.133 --> 00:10:34.510
I...

00:10:36.929 --> 00:10:38.931
<i>I</i> really...

00:10:39.014 --> 00:10:41.642
You're too kind. When I saw
the weather report this morning,

00:10:41.725 --> 00:10:44.228
I thought, "I have to bring one!"

00:10:44.311 --> 00:10:46.355
But I always end up doing this.

00:10:46.438 --> 00:10:49.566
The other day I got
soaked right through, and...

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:53.737
<i>h'... h' I'm ever reincarnated...</i>

00:10:53.821 --> 00:10:56.323
<i>I</i> don't want to be a human.

00:10:56.406 --> 00:10:58.867
<i>But not a dog or a cat, either.</i>

00:10:58.951 --> 00:11:02.037
<i>Because there are cute ones and not-cute ones.</i>

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:05.707
<i>If</i> I'm reincarnated, I...

00:11:08.168 --> 00:11:11.296
<i>I want to be a jellyfish.</i>

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:15.968
<i>A jellyfish just rocking gently on the waves.</i>

00:11:17.427 --> 00:11:19.263
You're finally back!

00:11:19.346 --> 00:11:23.183
Is everyone out tonight?
The place is locked, and I can't get inside!

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:25.644
Hey, why are you so drenched?

00:11:31.608 --> 00:11:32.568
It's commercial time!

00:11:32.651 --> 00:11:33.819
Clara!

00:11:34.987 --> 00:11:36.113
It's the second half!

00:11:36.196 --> 00:11:36.989
Tequila!

00:11:38.699 --> 00:11:41.076
Hey! What's wrong?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:46.790
Come out of there, Tsukimi! Tsukimi!

00:11:48.584 --> 00:11:55.257
<i>Why am I so depressed, Mom?</i>

00:11:55.340 --> 00:12:01.054
It's crazy, but maybe what
happened <i>at</i> the aquarium

00:12:01.138 --> 00:12:10.314
<i>made me feel like I</i> was...
<i>being treated like</i> a <i>normal girl...?</i>

00:12:15.193 --> 00:12:18.530
Welcome back. Did you borrow his umbrella?

00:12:18.614 --> 00:12:20.365
Of course I did.

00:12:20.449 --> 00:12:24.286
No man would just send me
home without one in this rain.

00:12:24.369 --> 00:12:28.665
I have to say, though, your way
of hooking men is pretty classic.

00:12:28.749 --> 00:12:31.335
"I don't have an umbrella,
so please let me share yours"?

00:12:31.418 --> 00:12:34.379
Not even the high school kids
are doing that one anymore.

00:12:34.463 --> 00:12:40.302
Can it! With a guy like that,
the classics work the best.

00:12:40.385 --> 00:12:43.847
I have to get home fast and
change clothes, so start driving.

00:12:43.931 --> 00:12:45.849
What, you're doing it now?

00:12:45.933 --> 00:12:47.976
With a guy like that,

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:50.646
the best thing is to call him
up right away "to return it."

00:12:51.897 --> 00:12:53.315
We're home...

00:12:53.315 --> 00:12:55.484
"No Boys Allowed "

00:12:55.484 --> 00:12:58.654
Or actually, whoa!
There's a pile of trash talking to me!

00:12:58.737 --> 00:13:02.532
What I'd like to know is,
what are you doing here?!

00:13:02.616 --> 00:13:06.244
Hey, more importantly, isn't it hot-pot day?

00:13:06.328 --> 00:13:08.121
Salmon sounds good to me.

00:13:08.205 --> 00:13:11.083
Silence! We've got bigger fish to fry today!

00:13:11.166 --> 00:13:14.252
We're all worn out from
the explanatory presentation!

00:13:14.336 --> 00:13:17.339
Presentation? Don't tell me
you went looking like that?

00:13:17.422 --> 00:13:19.257
Did they turn you away at the door?

00:13:19.341 --> 00:13:22.302
We're free to wear whatever we choose!

00:13:22.386 --> 00:13:24.805
It has nothing to do with the redevelopment!

00:13:24.888 --> 00:13:26.306
Yeah, right.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:30.102
Nobody wants to hear a trash
heap tell them not to redevelop.

00:13:30.185 --> 00:13:32.562
I... I can't breathe!

00:13:32.646 --> 00:13:37.025
Well? How'd it go? Did you get to say
"Please don't tear down Amamizu-kan"?

00:13:38.944 --> 00:13:43.573
Well, we're all cold from the rain,
so why don't we take a nice, hot bath?

00:13:43.657 --> 00:13:46.743
You can see the streetcars from the
window of the bathhouse on Block 2.

00:13:46.827 --> 00:13:49.997
I'd rather go to Block 4.
The clerk there has this quiet hotness...

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.665
I'll take that as a no.

00:13:53.458 --> 00:13:57.421
So that's why Tsukimi is so down.

00:13:57.504 --> 00:13:59.297
I'm home...

00:13:59.381 --> 00:14:00.632
Chieko!

00:14:00.716 --> 00:14:04.886
You're so late. I thought
Tsukimi went to go get you...

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:07.097
Well, I certainly never saw her.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.807
And?! What happened?!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:12.269
Were you able to able to
land a hit against that vixen?!

00:14:12.352 --> 00:14:17.774
How? I followed you out...

00:14:17.858 --> 00:14:19.651
It's all over!

00:14:19.735 --> 00:14:22.904
In any case, my mother is the owner,

00:14:22.988 --> 00:14:25.115
so we can't accomplish anything by protesting.

00:14:25.198 --> 00:14:27.325
Amamizu-kan will be swept
away by the raging seas of time,

00:14:27.409 --> 00:14:30.162
and in a few years it'll be a modern hotel,

00:14:30.245 --> 00:14:33.582
and no one will even remember this place!

00:14:33.665 --> 00:14:34.791
You're right...

00:14:34.875 --> 00:14:36.585
We're just boarders, after all.

00:14:36.668 --> 00:14:38.628
You're gonna give up without a fight?

00:14:48.055 --> 00:14:49.848
Tsukimi, get out here!

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.188
Get out here! Come on!

00:14:56.271 --> 00:14:58.648
Tsukimi! Tsukimi!

00:15:11.328 --> 00:15:12.996
She's dead!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.247
That made an awful noise...

00:15:14.331 --> 00:15:15.916
--What?
--I think she broke a bone!

00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:17.959
Er...

00:15:18.043 --> 00:15:20.504
Tsukimi, you're gonna give up without a fight?!

00:15:20.587 --> 00:15:22.589
Man, she's said that twice now.

00:15:22.672 --> 00:15:25.926
This is the only place you belong, isn't it?!

00:15:26.009 --> 00:15:27.844
This is the only place!

00:15:27.928 --> 00:15:29.888
Is this really the time to mope?!

00:15:31.807 --> 00:15:33.266
Doesn't her voice sound kind of low?

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.643
Yeah, really manly.

00:15:34.726 --> 00:15:37.854
You don't have time to be depressed either!

00:15:37.938 --> 00:15:40.023
All of you get your butts into the bath...

00:15:40.107 --> 00:15:41.691
That bruise is really something...

00:15:41.775 --> 00:15:44.569
...and take off those rags!

00:15:46.822 --> 00:15:50.325
My umbrella? What, right now?

00:15:50.408 --> 00:15:52.119
Yes, I suppose that's fine...

00:15:52.202 --> 00:15:54.204
--All right.
--I'm home!

00:15:54.287 --> 00:15:57.666
Ugh, the wig makes my head hot!
These clothes are hard to move around in!

00:15:57.749 --> 00:16:00.085
I'll still look like a chick as
long as I leave the bra stuffed!

00:16:00.168 --> 00:16:01.878
I'm wearing makeup anyway!

00:16:01.962 --> 00:16:03.547
What's all the racket about?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:07.884
Oh, Bro, perfect timing!
I'm gonna borrow Hanamori and the car!

00:16:07.968 --> 00:16:10.554
Sorry, but I have to go out.

00:16:10.637 --> 00:16:11.638
What?!

00:16:11.721 --> 00:16:15.559
Then I'll tag along. Drop me at Amamizu-kan!

00:16:15.642 --> 00:16:17.018
Amamizu-kan?

00:16:19.646 --> 00:16:21.064
Can I ask you something?

00:16:21.148 --> 00:16:23.608
What do you want? I'm in a hurry here!

00:16:23.692 --> 00:16:27.821
Does Tsukimi really live at Amamizu-kan?

00:16:27.904 --> 00:16:30.031
Huh? You're asking me that now?

00:16:30.115 --> 00:16:32.701
It's just that she wasn't at the presentation...

00:16:32.784 --> 00:16:35.787
Wait, "presentation"? The one in Amamizu?

00:16:35.871 --> 00:16:37.581
Yeah, that one.

00:16:37.664 --> 00:16:40.959
Are you with the enemy?
You're one of the ones trying to tear it down?!

00:16:41.042 --> 00:16:45.630
Well, not necessarily. But it's possible...

00:16:48.675 --> 00:16:50.385
Hey!

00:16:50.468 --> 00:16:54.598
Oh, Sir! You've been such a stranger lately.

00:16:54.681 --> 00:16:59.519
You're always saying "Let's do lunch,"
so when are you going to take me out?

00:16:59.603 --> 00:17:02.898
This weekend? Sure, that's no problem!

00:17:02.981 --> 00:17:07.235
I'm a lonely single girl, so I don't even
have anywhere to go on Friday nights!

00:17:07.319 --> 00:17:09.696
Hmm? What do I want to eat?

00:17:10.864 --> 00:17:14.910
Oh, Mr. Kubota? Thank you so
much for treating me the other day!

00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:17.120
It was so, so, so delish!

00:17:17.204 --> 00:17:19.581
I could see why Michelin gave it two stars!

00:17:19.664 --> 00:17:23.001
More like, I bet they'll give you three next year!

00:17:23.084 --> 00:17:26.046
Honestly, all the restaurants you open are just--

00:17:26.129 --> 00:17:29.716
Really? You're going to open another new one?!

00:17:31.051 --> 00:17:33.303
Tomorrow? Nope, no can do.

00:17:33.386 --> 00:17:36.932
And quit dragging your feet!
Have you convinced your wife yet?

00:17:37.015 --> 00:17:39.768
What? A hotel? You booked a room?

00:17:39.851 --> 00:17:42.520
Sure, I'll meet you there if
you get her to sign the forms.

00:17:42.604 --> 00:17:46.066
So hurry up and sell that passé kimono shop!

00:17:46.149 --> 00:17:48.735
Property values there are
going to plummet next year.

00:17:48.818 --> 00:17:50.737
Hmm? You bought me some Chanel?

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:54.074
Okay, I'll get it from you next time
I see you, but for now, close the deal!

00:17:54.157 --> 00:17:56.451
Stupid old lech...

00:17:56.534 --> 00:18:00.664
Miss lnari, anyone would think
you were a Ginza girlfriend-for-hire.

00:18:00.747 --> 00:18:05.043
So, I heard you were talking
about me to a girl in Section 3?

00:18:05.126 --> 00:18:09.422
Huh? I only said you were good.
You know, at the company party.

00:18:09.506 --> 00:18:12.259
You twit! If you just say I'm "good,"

00:18:12.342 --> 00:18:15.512
it sounds like I close my deals
between the sheets or something!

00:18:15.595 --> 00:18:16.888
It does?

00:18:16.972 --> 00:18:19.891
That's how women's minds work.

00:18:19.975 --> 00:18:23.186
Well, since you actually <i>do</i>
close them between the sheets...

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.062
What was that?

00:18:24.145 --> 00:18:25.313
U-Uh...

00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:31.820
I like public bathhouses, but the
Nunnery bath isn't half bad either!

00:18:31.903 --> 00:18:33.113
And I get fresh clothes!

00:18:33.196 --> 00:18:35.573
Which look just like the ones you wore before.

00:18:38.535 --> 00:18:40.370
What just happened?

00:18:40.453 --> 00:18:42.247
What?! What are you--

00:18:43.164 --> 00:18:45.083
That definitely sounded like Mayaya

00:18:45.166 --> 00:18:46.960
getting taken down with a
one-armed shoulder throw...

00:18:47.043 --> 00:18:49.004
Tsukimi, go peek inside.

00:18:49.087 --> 00:18:51.089
M-M-Me?

00:18:51.172 --> 00:18:54.968
But I always lose it watching
horror movies and stuff!

00:18:57.804 --> 00:19:01.474
Oh, no! What in the world is going on in there?!

00:19:01.558 --> 00:19:03.018
She could already be dead.

00:19:03.101 --> 00:19:04.436
Hurry, Tsukimi!

00:19:04.519 --> 00:19:05.895
Huh?!

00:19:09.566 --> 00:19:11.151
W-Well?

00:19:12.652 --> 00:19:14.988
Is a crane weaving in there or something?

00:19:15.071 --> 00:19:17.449
There's a strange woman I've never seen before.

00:19:26.875 --> 00:19:27.584
What?

00:19:27.625 --> 00:19:29.002
It can't be...

00:19:44.559 --> 00:19:46.811
Nicole Richie-style.

00:19:46.895 --> 00:19:48.229
What do you think?

00:19:48.313 --> 00:19:49.856
"Nicole Richie"?

00:19:49.939 --> 00:19:51.691
Who's that? A relative of Bae's?

00:19:51.775 --> 00:19:53.693
Sean Connery's not really my type.

00:19:53.777 --> 00:19:55.695
If we're talking about
"rack railways," the Shin-Etsu"

00:19:55.779 --> 00:19:59.282
Lionel Richie's daughter! Paris Hilton's friend!

00:19:59.366 --> 00:20:01.076
Google her later and read the Wiki article!

00:20:01.159 --> 00:20:05.497
Now listen up. This is how
drastically clothing can change a person!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.458
I'm not going to tell you to change
your look and be untrue to yourselves,

00:20:08.541 --> 00:20:10.835
or be Stylish or anything like that.

00:20:10.919 --> 00:20:15.090
But at least understand that
you can't fight in those clothes!

00:20:15.173 --> 00:20:18.676
To do battle, you have to dress for battle.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.805
You have to get the people
who judge by appearances

00:20:21.888 --> 00:20:25.141
to stand up and take notice!

00:20:25.225 --> 00:20:30.730
It's not that hard. It's something
anybody can do, whenever they want.

00:20:30.814 --> 00:20:32.107
So...

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:33.817
...armor yourselves!

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:40.156
<i>Mom, why do you think he
goes to such trouble for us'?</i>

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.992
<i>--Maybe he and his brother
are teaming up to tease me?</i>

00:20:42.992 --> 00:20:44.202
--C'mere, Banba! --Maybe he and his
brother are teaming up to tease me?

00:20:44.285 --> 00:20:45.370
--No, <i>I</i> know that's just
me being too self-conscious.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.996
--Tsukimi! Have you got an extension cord? --No,
<i>I</i> know that's just me being too self-conscious.

00:20:46.996 --> 00:20:48.540
--Yes! --No, <i>I</i> know that's just
me being too self-conscious.

00:20:48.623 --> 00:20:52.001
<i>But for some reason...</i>

00:20:52.085 --> 00:20:55.713
<i>A moment ago my heart
felt so heavy and painful,</i>

00:20:55.797 --> 00:20:58.174
<i>and now it's suddenly lighter...</i>

00:20:58.258 --> 00:21:00.802
Ugh, this hair!

00:21:00.885 --> 00:21:02.220
--That hurts.
--Fine, then!

00:21:02.303 --> 00:21:04.472
Afro... sealed!

00:21:11.688 --> 00:21:13.773
Banba, you look so cute!

00:21:13.857 --> 00:21:16.192
<i>Somehow, I'm starting to feel...</i>

00:21:16.192 --> 00:21:16.985
"Aren't we having a hot-pot party today?"

00:21:16.985 --> 00:21:18.236
<i>...so lighthearted.</i>

00:21:21.197 --> 00:21:30.206
<i>I really want you to
realize that you're gorgeous</i>

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:34.627
<i>Why haven't you realized it before this?</i>

00:21:34.711 --> 00:21:39.132
<i>It's like you've lost your heart</i>

00:21:39.215 --> 00:21:48.308
<i>I</i> want you to realize <i>it</i> right away,
right away, <i>I</i> want you to understand

00:21:48.391 --> 00:22:02.780
<i>I want you to realize it right</i> away,
<i>I want you to realize your beauty</i>

00:22:04.157 --> 00:22:08.620
<i>Because you're so very beautiful</i>

00:22:08.703 --> 00:22:12.707
<i>I want to convey that to you</i>

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:22.383
<i>Your loveliness, forever and ever</i>

00:22:22.467 --> 00:22:30.808
<i>I'll be so happy if you'll
just realize your loveliness</i>

00:22:30.892 --> 00:22:35.605
<i>I</i> care about you, you know

00:22:35.688 --> 00:22:44.948
Please, realize your beauty
